      "bbox_coordinate_system": "mineru_relative_0_1",
      "text_excerpt": "The energy levels and transition rates of promising laser-cooling candidate thorium anion Th\\( ^{-} \\) have been experimentally obtained in the current work. Three new excited states between the bound-bound electric dipole (E1) transition \\( ^{2}S_{1/2}^{o} \\leftrightarrow ^{4}F_{3/2}^{e} \\) of Th\\(\n...[truncated 648 chars]",
