      "bbox_coordinate_system": "mineru_relative_0_1",
      "text_excerpt": "Laser cooling [1,2], a crucial experimental technique for producing ultracold atoms and molecules, is opening up lots of brand-new research areas [3,4] and enabling experiments at unprecedentedly low temperatures [5,6]. Initially achieved in positive ions  \\( Ba^{+} \\)  [7] and  \\( Mg^{+} \\)  [8] in\n...[truncated 844 chars]",
