      "bbox_coordinate_system": "mineru_relative_0_1",
      "text_excerpt": "Only four atomic anions (Os\\( ^{-} \\) [18-23], Ce\\( ^{-} \\) [24,25], La\\( ^{-} \\) [22,26-29] and Th\\( ^{-} \\) [30,31]) have been discovered to possess the rare E1 transitions found in the entire periodic table. Among them, Ce\\( ^{-} \\) has numerous metastable lower states known as “dark states” betw\n...[truncated 1105 chars]",
