      "text_excerpt": "For Th\\(^-\\), its potential laser-cooling transition cycle \\(^2 S_{1/2}^{\\mathrm{o}} \\leftrightarrow {}^4 F_{3/2}^{\\mathrm{e}}\\) and a few anionic bound states were predicted by the Multiconfiguration Dirac-Hartree-Fock (MCDHF) method in 2019 [30]. On the experimental side, the electron affinity of \n...[truncated 1072 chars]",
