      "text_excerpt": "Currently, the lifetime of the upper state  \\( {}^{2}S_{1/2}^{0} \\)  of this E1 cooling transition is based solely on a theoretical estimate of 86  \\( \\mu \\) s [31] and a transition rate of  \\( 1.17 \\times 10^{-4} \\)  s \\( ^{-1} \\) . The absence of direct experimental measurements underscores the ne\n...[truncated 154 chars]",
